    "title": "Baseball Recap: Waseca Comes Up Short - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Team Reports ,\n1 days ago Waseca fell victim to Le Sueur-Henderson and their airtight pitching crew on Monday. They wound up with the same score they had in their last game (3-0), but sadly the team found themselves on the wrong side of the score this time. The loss continues a trend for them in their meetings with the Giants: they've now lost five in a row. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
